    "body": "[remove-element-unblocks-rendering.optional.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/dom/render-blocking/remove-element-unblocks-rendering.optional.html) tests that the element is not render-blocking after removing the `blocking=render` attribute, which implies that `defer` and `async` are not implicitly render-blocking. Does it count?\r\n\r\nAnd AFAIK this is a long-established and very standard behavior so if this is violated then there should be a lot of other tests failing...",
